    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Prompt context: evidence.yearContext() → ModelYearContext.
Reference year is Year.now(agent clock), not a fixed year.
2018 model / 2026 reference → difference 8 (example).
This is not a verified age or registration/service date.

Schema: exactly riskLevel, strengths, risks, uncertainties,
explanation. Categories: Low / Moderate / High /
Insufficient Information. Strict Java parser rejects
wrong fields/types, blank text and Markdown wrappers.
fontsize=24
bg=white</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
