    <panel_attributes>Then parser checks exact required risks / uncertainties;
rejects Low with constraint conflict and covered history denials.
Return candidate only after all checks → agent creates
RiskEvaluation("AI_SUCCESS", candidate, evidence, advisoryMessage).
Age / grounding failures throw Rejected; see alternatives below.
fontsize=24
bg=white</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
