  </element>
  <element>
    <id>Text</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1150</x>
      <y>1595</y>
      <w>775</w>
      <h>115</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Later: refreshValidity() runs on panel show and
every 250 ms while visible. If identity is lost,
clear displayed result and show OUTDATED.
CLI evaluate formats the returned envelope directly.
fontsize=24
halign=left
bg=white</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>Text</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>30</x>
      <y>1760</y>
      <w>2630</w>
      <h>145</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>llmClient is the existing GeminiAdapter through LLMClient, not a second client. It builds responseMimeType=application/json + responseJsonSchema; 30-second request timeout.
promptBuilder = PromptBuilder; schema = RiskAssessmentSchema; parser = ResponseParser; ageValidator = RiskAgeValidator; groundValidator = RiskGroundingValidator.
RiskEvidence = Java facts and limitations. RiskAssessment = riskLevel / strengths / risks / uncertainties / explanation. RiskEvaluation = status / assessment / evidence / message.
Reference year comes from the agent Clock. ModelYearContext: 2026 − 2018 = 8 model years (example), not exact in-service age. Covered age / grounding claims are rejected.
Saved vehicle/profile, strategy, cost/preparation and applicable clarification changes invalidate risk or advance contextVersion. Unsaved form edits do neither.
fontsize=24
halign=left
bg=white</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
